{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13134","headline":"酬包评事壁画山水见寄 · 皇甫冉","name":"酬包评事壁画山水见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一官知所傲，本意在云泉。\n濡翰生新兴，群峰忽眼前。\n黛中分远近，笔下起风烟。\n岩翠深樵路，湖光出钓船。\n寒侵赤城顶，日照武陵川。\n若览名山志，仍闻招隐篇。\n遂令江海客，惆怅忆闲田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}